<title>UK: ICCO seeks bids for 4,250 T buffer stock cocoa.</title>
<headline>ICCO seeks bids for 4,250 T buffer stock cocoa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Cocoa Organization (ICCO) invited bids by 1240 GMT on Friday for the sale of up to 4,250 tonnes of buffer stock cocoa.</p>
<p>It said the offer related to the list published on February 28.</p>
<p>Acceptances would be communicated to the parties concerned by 1400 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Jalil Hamid, London Newsroom 44-171-542 4985</p>
</text>
